{"id":"n88881-1-8","stage":4,"title":"희소식 · 喜讯","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88881-1-8-1","ko":"앞으로 네 전공의 전망이 매우 좋다더라.","zh":"听说你将来所学专业的就业前景非常好哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전공의","meaning":"专业","explanation":"전공：专业；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"전공","audio":"/audio/7c867cf5c98f49ab2c43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70828","senseId":"2","lemma":"전공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전망이","meaning":"展望，前景，前途","explanation":"전망：展望，前景，前途；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전망","audio":"/audio/a7ebd5e5ce12020bc986.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25256","senseId":"2","lemma":"전망","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋다더라.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；다더라：把以前听说的情况告诉对方，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"7c867cf5c98f49ab","term":"전공","zh":"专业","audio":"/audio/7c867cf5c98f49ab2c43.mp3","entryId":"70828","definition":"专门研究或学习的科目。","pronunciation":["전공"]},{"id":"a7ebd5e5ce12020b","term":"전망","zh":"展望，前景，前途","audio":"/audio/a7ebd5e5ce12020bc986.mp3","entryId":"25256","definition":"预见未来；或预测到的未来的状况。","pronunciation":["전ː망"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9ddbb284bf944b5ceb8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88881-1-8-2","ko":"응, 나에게는 정말 희소식이 아닐 수 없어.","zh":"嗯，对我来说这绝对是好消息啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나에게는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"희소식이","meaning":"喜讯","explanation":"희소식：喜讯；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"희소식","audio":"/audio/12b2f3211fce8c1065c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88881","senseId":"1","lemma":"희소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아닐","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"아닐","audio":"/audio/afd7e40742400b8d366e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"12b2f3211fce8c10","term":"희소식","zh":"喜讯","audio":"/audio/12b2f3211fce8c1065c4.mp3","entryId":"88881","definition":"好消息。","pronunciation":["히소식"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c3393ad79d5a8ab0cd0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.625,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88881","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说你将来所学专业的就业前景非常好哦。","嗯，对我来说这绝对是好消息啊。","下周就已经要开学了啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你将来所学专业的就业前景非常好哦。","嗯，对我来说这绝对是好消息啊。","下周就已经要开学了啊。"],"answer":1}]}
